<ul>
<li>Yes this scp will be able to infect others if certain conditions are met</li>
<li>I chose to include extinct predatory animals for the purpose similar to how some predators use lures to draw in prey. With how popular tattoos are, more fancy exotic tattoos would catch the eyes of would be prey which the scp wants.</li>
<li>being a predatory creature the reason it stayed on the agent allowing it to be contained is because by the time the foundation got a hold of the corpse of the latest victim it was basically starving so the moment it jumped to the agent it was going to hunt the agent despite it being obvious that it would be captured.</li>
<li>I did plan to have a interview segment with the agent and a foundation scientist</li>
</ul>

