<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Unfortunately, I’m not sure I completely understand how your scp functions at the moment. So it’s a predatory tattoo that “appears” on random people’s skin? Why wouldn’t the victim automatically be suspicious of its appearance?</p>
