<p>Well the reason why i wrote the narrative like that is to give the reviewers and critics a idea of what I’m going for. If i had written as one would with the an scp article i’m not sure people would of gotten what i was going for. As for being flat unfortunately while i could of done better with that i had to deal with, as the guy Zyn wrote, a word count limit. Heck after seeing that message from Zyn i had to delete some elements from this just to fit with said word limit (thankfully i do have the original file so if i get it greenlit i can use it).</p>
<p>I will say though i do have alot planned for the agent including a interview a day before his demise where he talks about his regrets as well as the anomalous entity on his back and what it shows him.</p>

